    "body": "This run gated `b6089ea6e`, which is before the merge of PR #4405. It is the known `wire_post` temp-file failure: the two tests wrote to fixed names in the system temp folder, and on the shared runner another user owns those files. PR #4405 merged after this run and fixes it. The post-merge run of the merge of #4405 should be green and close this issue.\n",
